  <relatedDocument typeCode="RPLC"><parentDocument><id root="2.25.300482169457150407075386186229743407818.2" extension="6796b0e9-6239-42f6-beb6-927e28beb52f"/><setId root="2.25.300482169457150407075386186229743407818.2" extension="b695a723-59a6-4675-95b6-09f522053a3a"/><versionNumber value="1774552020001"/></parentDocument></relatedDocument><component><structuredBody><component><section><code code="71482-4" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" codeSystemName="LOINC" displayName="Risk assessment Document"/><title>Source Form Document</title><text><paragraph>Corrected synthetic Pregnancy Risk Assessment source report as of March 26, 2026. Replaces the inconsistent payer-branded scanned demonstration form; DOB, EDD, current medication and coverage now agree with the CDA and story.</paragraph><renderMultiMedia referencedObject="SourceForm"/></text><entry><observationMedia classCode="OBS" moodCode="EVN" ID="SourceForm"><id root="017c1c6e-894e-46c5-afa0-463083769f1f" extension="20c56fc0-7c83-4ca9-b84d-f61f333b7a5f"/><value xsi:type="ED" representation="B64" mediaType="application/pdf"></value></observationMedia></entry></section></component><component><section>
              <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.5" extension="2015-08-01"/>
              <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.5"/><code code="11450-4" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" codeSystemName="LOINC" displayName="Problem list - Reported"/>
              <title>Problems</title>
              <text><paragraph>Risk assessment completed March 26, 2026 at 2:07 PM CDT. Mimi Elena Shell, DOB August 10, 1997, age 28; G3P2002; current gestational age 11 weeks 0 days. Initial prenatal visit: March 20, 2026 at 10 weeks 1 day. LMP January 8, 2026; established EDD October 15, 2026; singleton pregnancy confirmed March 4.</paragraph><table border="1" width="100%"><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Problem / risk factor</th><th>Status / relevance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3/24/2026</td><td>Pre-existing hypothyroidism</td><td>Active and treated. Initial prenatal testing collected March 20 and reviewed March 24: TSH 4.1 mIU/L; Free T4 0.9 ng/dL. Levothyroxine increased from 100 mcg to 125 mcg by mouth daily on March 24. Current dose at this snapshot: 125 mcg daily.</td></tr><tr><td>3/20/2026</td><td>Elevated pre-pregnancy weight / BMI</td><td>Pre-pregnancy weight 180 lb; height approximately 65 in. Calculated BMI approximately 30; the source materials described maternal obesity, but exact height and classification are not independently established. Relevant to pregnancy surveillance.</td></tr></tbody></table></text></section>
          </component><component><section>
              <code code="75310-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" codeSystemName="LOINC" displayName="Health concerns document"/>
              <title>Health Concerns</title>
              <text><table border="1" width="100%"><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Health concern</th><th>Basis / relevance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3/20/2026</td><td>Prior cesarean delivery with subsequent successful VBAC</td><td>Edwin Smith: cesarean, 8/3/2022. Molly Beatrice Curic: successful VBAC, 3/31/2024. Patient desires another vaginal birth if clinically appropriate.</td></tr><tr><td>3/20/2026</td><td>Reported historical gestational diabetes; unconfirmed</td><td>The older obstetric-history narrative reports prior gestational diabetes; the risk form does not affirm it, and the current story does not establish details. Retained as an unconfirmed historical report, not a current gestational-diabetes diagnosis.</td></tr><tr><td>3/26/2026</td><td>Social / lifestyle review</td><td>No identified social or lifestyle risk was documented in the supplied early-pregnancy history. Historical stress level 3 of 5; no assistance requested. No tobacco/vaping or recreational-drug exposure reported; alcohol use before pregnancy was reported without quantity/frequency.</td></tr><tr><td>3/26/2026</td><td>Care coordination</td><td>Original source form indicates no provider request for care coordination at this snapshot. No future doula referral or care-team relationship is asserted.</td></tr></tbody></table></text></section>
          </component></structuredBody></component></ClinicalDocument>
